OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval Coventry pub reopens
OL,4,Aafter a decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple in Coventry are to reopen a
OL,7,Fwell-known historic pub in the city
OL,8,Fcentre.
OL,10,FThe Whitefriars Old Ale House, on
OL,11,FGosford Street, is one of the city's
OL,12,Foldest buildings, dating back to the
OL,13,F14th century.
OL,15,FIt originally served as part of the
OL,16,FWhitefriars monastery in the 1300s,
OL,17,Fbefore operating as a butcher's shop
OL,18,Funtil 1990 and later converting into a
OL,19,Ftraditional real ale pub.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
