OL,3,GNEWSAMedieval Coventry pub reopens
OL,4,Aafter a decade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe venue shut in 2016, but the owners
OL,7,Fsay it has now been restored to its
OL,8,Fformer glory after they spent the last
OL,9,Fseven years renovating it.
